"profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Zoogryph/", "num_games_owned": 339, "num_reviews": 110, "playtime_forever": 2252, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108, "last_played": 1742146180, "avatar": "ca6b4bb4f79d3802913de9d0166c52591a4eb263"}, "language": "english", "review": "(I have played this game for longer than listed as I previously had it on Xbox Game Pass)\nA gem of a game that I heard about from a random article online. It's a fast paced FPS roguelike with fantastic crisp movement, a wide variety of weapons, modifiers, and abilities, with a surprising amount of replay-ability. Not to mention it has 2 person co-op which few FPS roguelikes have. \nThe most amazing thing about it is that in every run I have a moment thinking I have a perfect combo in terms of my arsenal even though it is made of completely different things every single time. That goes to show how varied and diverse the game is.", "timestamp_created": 1692807171, "timestamp_updated": 1692807205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144838989", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099585766", "personaname": "Plonker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_IC0075/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 4204, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 858, "last_played": 1761877262, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "If Borderlands and Ghostrunner had a kid and he dressed up as Titanfall for Halloween.", "timestamp_created": 1692776800, "timestamp_updated": 1692776800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "s